{
  "name": "11 · Review Replier (Kaamchor AI · MAP 2.0 · Marketing)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⭐ Review Replier – Google reviews on autopilot\nEvery hour: fetch new Google reviews → Claude classifies each one and drafts an on-brand reply → happy reviews get the reply posted → angry ones are NOT posted; you get an email draft to handle them yourself.\n\n**Setup (15 min)**\n1. **Get new reviews** + **Post reply on Google**: Google Business Profile API access (OAuth2 credential with scope `business.manage`). Replace `YOUR_ACCOUNT_ID` and `YOUR_LOCATION_ID` in both URLs.\n2. **Claude**: add your Anthropic API key credential. Edit the brand voice in *Claude reads review*.\n3. **Draft alert to owner**: connect Gmail and put your email in *To*. It only creates a draft.\n4. Execute once, check the replies, then Activate.\n\n---\nPart of **MAP – 12 AI agents** (Kaamchor AI).",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "7a967552-3aa5-4f6e-ae79-47b8e4ac112b",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -320,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "8b30f7ea-34e9-495a-8985-31e017fe505d",
      "name": "Every hour",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://mybusiness.googleapis.com/v4/accounts/YOUR_ACCOUNT_ID/locations/YOUR_LOCATION_ID/reviews",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "oAuth2Api",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "pageSize",
              "value": "20"
            },
            {
              "name": "orderBy",
              "value": "updateTime desc"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "df72a01c-7fd9-4e29-8bb9-259efbbdbc78",
      "name": "Get new reviews",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const stars = { ONE: 1, TWO: 2, THREE: 3, FOUR: 4, FIVE: 5 };\nreturn ($input.first().json.reviews || [])\n  .filter(r => !r.reviewReply)\n  .map(r => ({ json: { review_id: r.reviewId, name: (r.reviewer?.displayName || 'there').split(' ')[0], stars: stars[r.starRating] || 0, comment: r.comment || '(no text)' } }));"
      },
      "id": "8be8d903-ef78-47a4-9c2e-db26e2fa3653",
      "name": "Only unanswered",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You manage Google reviews for a local business.\nBusiness: Bright Smile Dental. Tone: warm, short, human, thank them by first name, never argue, never mention prices or medical details, sign off as 'The Bright Smile team'.\n\nREVIEW ({{ $json.stars }} stars) from {{ $json.name }}:\n{{ $json.comment }}\n\nClassify the sentiment (happy / neutral / angry). angry = 1-2 stars OR a complaint, threat, refund demand or anything legal. Write a reply of max 60 words in the brand voice. For angry reviews also write a one-line summary for the owner.",
        "hasOutputParser": true
      },
      "id": "239dbcc5-9992-4a33-a13c-77ec07515a3a",
      "name": "Claude reads review",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "claude-sonnet-5-5",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.5
        }
      },
      "id": "45769398-ffd0-4091-893e-920d93e6d2ae",
      "name": "Claude",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatAnthropic",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        620,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsonSchemaExample": "{\n  \"sentiment\": \"happy\",\n  \"angry\": false,\n  \"reply\": \"Thank you Aman! So glad the cleaning was quick and painless. See you at your next check-up. The Bright Smile team\",\n  \"owner_summary\": \"\"\n}"
      },
      "id": "eda76c91-43ba-40a2-b691-a304bec73963",
      "name": "Structured output",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        780,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "68c9db29-e5ca-4c79-be8c-a6f8e7fd907c",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.output.angry }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "884036e0-5c28-40be-9b08-e0482dcda13f",
      "name": "Angry?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        880,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "draft",
        "subject": "=Angry {{ $('Only unanswered').item.json.stars }}-star review from {{ $('Only unanswered').item.json.name }}",
        "message": "=Review: {{ $('Only unanswered').item.json.comment }}\n\nSummary: {{ $json.output.owner_summary }}\n\nSuggested reply (NOT posted):\n{{ $json.output.reply }}",
        "options": {
          "sendTo": "you@yourbusiness.com"
        }
      },
      "id": "76b428f9-cf60-4a96-90ab-8c7b54756b78",
      "name": "Draft alert to owner",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        1120,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "url": "=https://mybusiness.googleapis.com/v4/accounts/YOUR_ACCOUNT_ID/locations/YOUR_LOCATION_ID/reviews/{{ $('Only unanswered').item.json.review_id }}/reply",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "oAuth2Api",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ comment: $json.output.reply }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e08f034a-1e79-42df-afa2-b34ebd0ea2a5",
      "name": "Post reply on Google",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1120,
        120
      ]
    }
  ],
